    "value_type": "flat additive values; crit rate / crit damage are percentage points added to the panel (not multipliers)",
    "scope": {
      "statement": "account-wide, one shared level; bonus applies to characters currently deployed in the party",
      "evidence": [
        "namu (S4) §1 item 5: '푸카 특훈의 속성 보너스는 출전 중인 캐릭터에게만 적용됩니다' (reads like the in-game description)",
        "kamigame (S1): '強化内容は出撃中のキャラ全てに反映'",
        "game8 (S3): 'permanent, account-wide stat-sink'; GameFAQs (S2): 'They are account wide buffs'; X (S13): 'PERMANENT STATS TO YOUR ENTIRE NTE ROSTER'",
        "no source describes a per-character training level; UI lives in the City Tycoon window (top-left) per arca 184652010"
      ],
      "confidence": "high (account-wide), medium (exact 'deployed-only' mechanics)"
    },
    "panel_display": {
      "known": false,
      "statement": "No source states whether the character stat screen includes the Boot Camp bonus. The 'deployed characters only' wording suggests a party-scoped buff, which may or may not be reflected on the out-of-combat character panel.",
      "calculator_relevance": "The calculator never syncs the in-game character panel (no panel table in user_data.sqlite3; stats are reconstructed from growth tables + equipment + fork + likeability + world_bonus). nte-core measured combat values (native:attack / native:maxHp, '实测属性') are in-combat and would include any active bonus, so a post-1.4 battle record would show reconstructed ATK lower than measured ATK by the training amount unless a training source is added.",
      "user_check": "Compare the character screen ATK before/after buying one Boot Camp level in game, or compare 实测 vs reconstructed attack in a battle record captured after 2026-09-30 (the installed account's 3 battle records are all from 2026-09-05/09, pre-1.4)."
    }
  },
